  "name": "XP auras only modify kill XP when their source mask names creature kills (#4908)",
  "contract": "The misc value of SPELL_AURA_MOD_XP_PCT is a mask of XP sources: 1 creature kills, 2 quests, 4 professions, 8 battlegrounds. Each level-20 player kills a level-20 Elwynn creature whose base award under the live realm rates is 146 (see xp-ascension-rates). Keeper's Scroll: Khaz'goroth (993955, +25% mask 4, gathering and crafting), The Hunt V (83258, +10% mask 2, quests) and Exterminator Tier 1 (282, -100% mask 2, 'You can only get experience from Creatures or PvP') leave kill XP at 146; before the fix they paid 183, 160 and 0. Keeper's Scroll: Norgannon (993943) has a +10% kill effect (mask 1) and a +10% quest effect (mask 2): only the kill effect applies, 158 * 1.1 = 173, then Rate.XP.Global gives 160, instead of 177 with both effects.",
